+- [ ] Silent/failed target is labeled explicitly, not collapsed to generic UNKNOWN.
+
+## Global DSP
+- [ ] With Global DSP ON, log contains `global_dsp_transport` with raw creation capability.
+- [ ] If transport is available, bounded `global_dsp_probe` starts and records meter source plus measured delta.
+- [ ] `VERIFIED_GLOBAL_MIX` / ACTIVE appears only after real proof; otherwise status remains UNAVAILABLE or AVAILABLE_UNVERIFIED.
+- [ ] Capability loss neutralizes DSP before Media fallback.
+
+## Linked Lock / UI
+- [ ] Default Linked Lock can be toggled while engine is running and does not snap back from stale service state.
+- [ ] Linked ON keeps both ceiling sliders visible but disabled/dimmed in Simple and Advanced.
+- [ ] `Вернуть настройки по умолчанию` restores normalizer defaults but preserves logs, calibration and app rules.
+- [ ] `Частотный спектр` is understandable as diagnostic-only and does not imply it controls normalization.
+
+## Artifact
+APK source commit: awaiting final CI
+GitHub Actions run: awaiting final CI
+Artifact: `SoundCeiling-v0.7.2-debug-apk`
+APK SHA-256: awaiting final CI
